From 5ebfebb7336872f42fb274b4696dc5b4af1ce6ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grzegorz <grzegorz2047@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:24:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] TrinityXSX: add Frame Generation (MihawkGen) toggle in
 AppSettings

- Read and update [display] framegen = off|2|3|4 in trinityxsx-library.profile
- Expose Off / 2x / 3x / 4x toggle in the OPTIONS (Profile & Language) menu
- Indicate [restart] when saved factor differs from active PW_FRAMEGEN
---
